<title>USA: White Settlement, Texas won by Sowest Sec.</title>
<headline>White Settlement, Texas won by Sowest Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Sec. said it won $2.045 million of White Settlement, Texas, limited tax notes, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.91 percent.</p>
</text>
